Template: bitcoin-knots/prune-bool
Type: boolean
Default: false
_Description: Do you want to enable pruning?
 Save storage space by pruning (deleting) old blocks 
 and keeping only a limited copy of the blockchain.

Template: bitcoin-knots/prune
Type: string
_Description: Value for pruning (must be at least 550 or 0/1) in MiB:
 0 = disabled, 1 = allow manual pruning via RPC, 
 >=550 = automatically prune block files to stay under the target size in MiB

Template: bitcoin-knots/prune-bool-fail
Type: note
_Description: Couldn't configure prune
 Couldn't configure the prune setting as expected, 
 please set your value manually in /etc/bitcoin/bitcoin.conf

Template: bitcoin-knots/prune-fail
Type: note
_Description: Bad value for prune
 Prune must be O, 1 or superior or equal to 550

Template: bitcoin-knots/txindex
Type: boolean
Default: false
_Description: Do you want to enable transaction index?
 This is required for electrum servers and various other software

Template: bitcoin-knots/txindex-fail
Type: note
_Description: Couldn't configure txindex
 Couldn't configure the txindex setting as expected, 
 please set your value manually in /etc/bitcoin/bitcoin.conf
